{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14106414","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14106414","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1410641401:0":{"text":"织叶到底想去哪？这边好像不是去神殿建筑地的路啊。","source_cn":"织叶到底想去哪？这边好像不是去神殿建筑地的路啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D01EDA754092127","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410641402:1":{"text":"你没听斐利尔提起过吗？织叶曾经引领我们的祖先找到了萨洛克兰。","source_cn":"你没听斐利尔提起过吗？织叶曾经引领我们的祖先找到了萨洛克兰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF44B1BC0C235712C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410641403:0":{"text":"我想，也许它的职责便是在有人迷茫时给出指引。","source_cn":"我想，也许它的职责便是在有人迷茫时给出指引。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DE1D5CA001E29E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410641404:1":{"text":"又或许，这一次是斐利尔在通过织叶指引我们……总之先跟上吧。","source_cn":"又或许，这一次是斐利尔在通过织叶指引我们……总之先跟上吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACB26E70CF8DB1F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"祖娅","source":"祖娅","status":"source"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"因度厄","source":"因度厄","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}